msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-admin.php:130
msgid "Open Bolt Edit"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:30
msgid "Front-end editing"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:31
msgid "AI often hard-codes the text and images in the templates, so a client cannot change anything without a developer."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:32
msgid "The agent starts from your idea or from your own HTML template, builds the theme, and hands all static content to Bolt Edit. You and your clients then edit text, buttons and images right on the website. The site keeps working, and shows its content, even when the plugin is switched off."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:33
msgid "Example: Make every heading, text and button editable, also in the footer."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:38
msgid "Agents often paste the header and footer into every page, or forget the 404, search and blog templates. Those then fall back to the plain WordPress look."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:39
msgid "One shared header and footer for the whole site, repeated sections in one file, and a 404, search and blog template in your design."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:40
msgid "Example: Always add a simple landing page template without a menu."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:44
msgid "Pages and site basics"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:45
msgid "A page that only exists as a template does not show up under Pages in WordPress, so you cannot manage it or link to it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:46
msgid "The agent creates a real WordPress page for every page, sets your homepage as the front page, and builds a menu you can edit and reorder. The theme also gets a proper name and screenshot, and a favicon or share image only when you provide one."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:47
msgid "Example: Always add a Contact page and a Privacy page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:51
msgid "Content and images"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:52
msgid "Hard-coded text and images can only be changed by a developer, and some content, like products, already belongs to another plugin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:53
msgid "Every text and image on the page becomes editable on the front end. Images go into the Media Library in a fixed frame, so replacing a photo never breaks the layout. Content from plugins like ACF or WooCommerce stays where it is. Images come from your own files, free Pexels and Unsplash photos, or the image model of your AI."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:54
msgid "Example: Keep button labels under 30 characters."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:58
msgid "Design system"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:59
msgid "AI-written CSS gets messy fast: values everywhere, classes that fight each other, and a design that is hard to change later."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:60
msgid "The agent uses your CSS framework if you bring one. If not, Bolt Edit gives it a default framework to build with, so the code stays clean. It also adds a private brand guide page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:61
msgid "Example: Use at most two font families."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:65
msgid "Mobile"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:66
msgid "AI-built sections often look fine on a desktop and break on a phone."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:67
msgid "Every section works from 360 px wide, and the mobile menu works with touch and keyboard. The focus outline stays visible and animations respect visitors who want less motion."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:68
msgid "Example: Use the breakpoints 768 px and 1200 px."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:72
msgid "Speed"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:73
msgid "Fonts from outside servers and heavy images slow a site down, and fonts from outside servers are a GDPR risk."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:74
msgid "Fonts load from your own server, styles and scripts load the WordPress way, and images are resized, converted to WebP and compressed before they are uploaded."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:75
msgid "Example: Only load a script on the pages that use it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:79
msgid "Safety"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:80
msgid "Text from the database or from a visitor can hide harmful code if a theme prints it as it is."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:81
msgid "The agent is told to clean everything it prints and to check that only the right people can save things. It is an instruction, so it helps, but it is not a guarantee."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:82
msgid "These are only a few basic checks on the code the agent writes. They do not replace a security plugin, so it is recommended to use one as well."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:83
msgid "Example: Never put passwords or API keys in theme files."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:87 includes/class-bolt-edit-seo.php:250
msgid "SEO"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:88
msgid "Bolt Edit pages keep their content in the theme, so SEO plugins like Yoast and Rank Math see an empty page. Google does not mind, but those plugins do."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:89
msgid "The agent first checks whether your site already has an SEO plugin, then follows one of two paths. Either way, every page gets one main heading and every image gets alt text."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:92
msgid "You have an SEO plugin"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:93
msgid "The plugin owns your titles, descriptions and sitemap. The agent only gives it the text of your pages, so its content checks work, and it prints no SEO tags itself."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:96
msgid "You have no SEO plugin"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:97
msgid "Bolt Edit adds an SEO box to every page and post with a title and a meta description. The agent fills it in from the real page content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:100
msgid "Example: Write SEO titles in Dutch and keep them under 55 characters."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:104
msgid "Final checks"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:105
msgid "Without a check, a theme can look finished and still miss pages, have the wrong images or broken edit buttons."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:106
msgid "The agent runs a checklist before it calls a theme done, and follows a list of things it must never do."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-ai-instructions.php:107
msgid "Example: Also check the site at 320 px wide."
msgstr ""

